id: poko-priest
name: Poko Priest
order: 8
optionOf: spirit-of-namek
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 2 and a Ki Point Cost of 5(bT), create a Minion. This Minion is of the Namekian Race and must possess the Dark Vassal Factor. In addition, that Minion gains 2(bT) Attribute Points to spend at Character Creation.
text: >
  Poko Priest [1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 2 and a Ki Point Cost of 5(bT), create a Minion. This Minion is of the Namekian Race and must possess the Dark Vassal Factor. In addition, that Minion gains 2(bT) Attribute Points to spend at Character Creation.

---

# Its own Maneuver, listed while this Option is had (poko-priest-maneuver.dbu). The Minion itself waits on Minions.
